<p rendition="#indent-2">2. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Lupus</hi></hi>. der Wolf. (Fr. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">le loup.</hi></hi> Engl. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">the<lb/>
